6)\n\n>\n\n[Properties in Borivali West](/buy/mumbai/borivali-west-1a256b7a21)\n\n>\n\nGreenbuilding Lifescapes LLP\n\n>\n\n![share-primary](/assets/icons/share-primary.svg)\n\n![compare-inactive-secondary](/assets/icons/compare-inactive-secondary.svg)\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/greenbuilding-lifescapes-llp-maya-mamta-bedroom-1673261666.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/greenbuilding-lifescapes-llp-maya-mamta-elevation-1700974602.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/greenbuilding-lifescapes-llp-maya-mamta-bedroom-1673261712.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/greenbuilding-lifescapes-llp-maya-mamta-kitchen-1673261689.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/greenbuilding-lifescapes-llp-maya-mamta-bedroom-1673261666.webp)VIEW ALL\n\n![Propert-Icon](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/191122061334-new-3.webp)\n\n# Maya Mamta\n\n6VF2+P7X, maya mamta society, opp gokhale school, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400092\n\nBorivali West\n\n₹1.05 Cr - 2.87 Cr\n\n₹1.05 Cr - 2.87 Cr\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n[Price & Floor Plan](#Price & Floor Plan)\n\n![video-primary](/assets/icons/video-primary.svg)\n\n![call-rm](/assets/icons/call-rm.svg)\n\n![calendar-primary](/assets/icons/calendar-primary.svg)\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n## Overview\n\nGreenbuilding Lifescapes LLP recently introduced a residential project called Greenbuilding Maya Mamta in Borivali West, Mumbai. This project covers 0.28 acres and offers various facilities for residents. Launched in May 2022, it is currently under construction, providing units ranging from 429.0 to 1643.0 sq.ft. There are a total of 46 units in one building. The possession date for Greenbuilding Maya Mamta is expected in October 2025. The project includes 1, 2, and 3 BHK units and is located at Plot Bearing F.P. No.159, of T.P.S, Borivali West.\n\n1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Oct 2025\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹23,776/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n443 - 1206 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* CSIA is approximately 20 km away from Borivali West, enhancing its accessibility.\n* Borivali West serves as a housing hub linked to the rest of Mumbai through the Western suburban railway line.\n\n* The upcoming Metro Line 2 is poised to enhance connectivity in the area.\n* Options include 1 BHK, 2 BHK, and 3 BHK residences in the area.\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\nSummary of Online Reviews Proximity to Essentials: Most reviewers appreciate that the project is located within a short walking distance of markets, schools, hospitals, and the Pepsi ground. Transportation Access: Residents highlight the excellent connectivity provided by nearby bus stops, the metro station within 2 kilometers, and the close proximity to Borivali Railway Station. Security and Safety: Multiple reviews mention a strong sense of safety due to 24/7 CCTV surveillance, active police patrolling, and a secure neighborhood environment. Maintenance and Cleanliness: The locality is generally described as well-maintained with clean and wide roads, although some issues arise during the monsoon. Quiet Atmosphere: Several users note that the neighborhood manages to be peaceful and tranquil despite being in a well-developed and happening part of Mumbai.\n\n![up-thumb](/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg)\n\n### The good things\n\nConnectivity and Commute\n\nThe project is strategically located near SV Road, Link Road, and the Western Express Highway, ensuring seamless travel across Mumbai.\n\nModern Amenities\n\nThe building features high-quality facilities including a gymnasium, power backup, high-speed lifts, and multi-level car parking.\n\nEducational and Health Hub\n\nTop-tier schools like St. Lawrence and Ryan Christian, along with multi-specialty hospitals, are located within a 1-kilometer radius.\n\nDesign and Ventilation\n\nApartments are noted for their efficient layouts, French windows, and proper ventilation that allows for ample natural light and fresh air.\n\nSustainable Features\n\nThe society incorporates eco-friendly measures such as a rainwater harvesting system and a sewage treatment plant on the premises.\n\n![down-thumb](/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg)\n\n### Needs improvement\n\nHigh Real Estate Costs\n\nProperty and rental rates in this specific pocket of Borivali West are considered high and potentially unaffordable for some budget-conscious seekers.\n\nMonsoon Waterlogging\n\nSome residents have reported that the surrounding roads can become water-logged and wet during the heavy monsoon season.\n\nLimited Open Spaces\n\nThere is a perceived lack of significant greenery or large open areas for children to play within the immediate project footprint.\n\nPeak Hour Congestion\n\nPublic transport options like buses and trains serving the area are reported to be heavily overcrowded during morning and evening rush hours.\n\nInfrastructure Gaps\n\nA few reviews point out that some streetlights in the vicinity do not function consistently, making night-time walking slightly uncomfortable in specific patches.\n\n---\n\nThe Verdict\n\nGreat for families\n\nExcellent for commuters\n\nHigh investment value\n\nPremium urban living\n\nAvoid if seeking large green spaces\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/gym-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-secondary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/jogging-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/party-hall-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/party-hall-secondary.svg)\n\nParty Hall\n\n![amenities/snooker-pool-billiards-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/snooker-pool-billiards-secondary.svg)\n\nSnooker