ow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe developer of Maya Mamta is Greenbuilding Lifescapes LLP.\n\n## About The Developer\n\n![Developer for Maya Mamta:Greenbuilding Lifescapes LLP](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/191122061334-new-3.webp)\n\n## Greenbuilding Lifescapes LLP\n\nGreenbuilding Lifescapes LLP is a leading real estate developer dedicated to creating premium residential projects, modern homes & sustainable commercial spaces. With a focus on quality construction, innovative design & timely project delivery, the company has earned a reputation for transforming ideas into exceptional living & working spaces. Committed to integrity, transparency & customer satisfaction, Greenbuilding Lifescapes LLP continues to shape the future of urban real estate, offering homes & developments that combine comfort, style & long-term value for homebuyers & investors alike.\n\n## Properties In The Same Area\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/konark-developer-konark-32-west-view-elevation-1779782095.webp)\n\n![Konark 32 West View](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/150923041604-newproject-3.webp)\n\nKonark 32 West View\n\nBorivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹3.35 Cr - 7.71 Cr\n\n2, 3, 4.5 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/dotom-realty-dotom-vue-elevation-1747896338.jpg)\n\n![Dotom Vue](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/111125030803-dotommvlogo.webp)\n\nDotom Vue\n\nBorivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹95 L - 1.5 Cr\n\n1, 2 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/dgs-group-builders-dgs-sheetal-shashank-elevation-1754035295.jpg)\n\n![DGS Sheetal Shashank](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/230822105140-newproject-20