ta Heights\")\n![Project Entrance in Mamta Heights](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Mamta Heights\")\n![Parking Area in Mamta Heights](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Parking Area in Mamta Heights\")\n![Project Entrance in Mamta Heights](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Mamta Heights\")\n![Parking Area in Mamta Heights](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Parking Area in Mamta Heights\")\n![Project Entrance in Mamta Heights](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Mamta Heights\")\n![Project Entrance in Mamta Heights](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Mamta Heights\")\n![Project Entrance in Mamta Heights](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Mamta Heights\")\n\n## About [Borivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Borivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\n![Borivali West Video](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Borivali West Video\")\n\n## About Raja Builders\n\n![Raja Builders](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Raja Builders\")\n\n|  |\n| --- |\n| Our buildings and complexes are mostly in suburban parts of Mumbai city with at least one building on virtually every street in Bandra, Khar and Santacruz! Our personal involvement at every stage of our projects is part of our passion for creating homes - and the results show in the consistent quality which is unparalleled in the industry. Every project of ours is a monument of sorts!    As a means of further diversification, the Raja Group has made forays in the Hospitality Industry and are the owners of Mosaté - a Thai eatery in Khar (W) and the brand Club IX, one of the Mumbai's oldest Retro Bars. Besides, the group is also come to be known as the pioneer in the concept of service apartment hotels in the city. |\n\n![Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner\")\n![](data:image/svg+xml;base64,)\n![H Rishabraj  Samaj Darshan photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"H Rishabraj  Samaj Darshan photo\")\n![Modispaces Ganges  phot